# pf1 (2026-10-27): profiled (APS5_PROFILE_DRAW/GPU) and sampled (worker + committer) run: why APS5_STORING_TEMPLATES
# did not lower the committer's busy time in rc3 ([rescache] address-based proofs/refusals, [bda-template]), the
# dispatch miss items with the preparer, and the symbolized committer/worker profile of the hit path
# (collapsed_report.py --libs D:\Games\AnyPS5\PPSA26344-elem\libs).
measure 30
base 100
st 100 switch APS5_STORING_TEMPLATES on
dsst 100 deferstores on;;switch APS5_STORING_TEMPLATES on
dsstm 100 deferstores on;;switch APS5_STORING_TEMPLATES on;;switch APS5_PIPELINE_DISPATCH_MISSES on
